# Standard Paired CTA Deck

- Use the shared `CTADuo` component whenever “Book a consult” and “Check your date” appear together.
- Present the shared pair as the compact Howe Sound Wedding DJ dual cassette deck with its powered display, tape windows, transport controls, and ticker.
- Do not create route-specific visual variants of the paired CTA.
- The full-size `EncoreCassetteDeck` is the intentional exception and remains the homepage finale treatment.
- Keep both actions obvious without hover, keyboard accessible, touch friendly, and readable on mobile.
- Preserve tracking surfaces and their existing destinations when reusing the component.
- The bottom display may scroll longer copy like a powered stereo display. Supply a reduced-motion fallback.
